EX NO 20: C PROGRAM TO CONVERT THE GIVEN STRING TO LOWERCASE.
DATE:30-04-2025


AIM:
To write a program to convert the string to lowercase.

ALGORITHM:
1. Start.
2. Define the required variable.
3. Convert the string to lowercase.
4. Read the value using scanf.
5. Print out the answer.
6. End.

PROGRAM:
#include <stdio.h>
int main() {
 char str[100];
 int i = 0;
 scanf("%s", str); 
 while (str[i] != '\0') {
 if (str[i] >= 'A' && str[i] <= 'Z') {
 str[i] = str[i] + 32; }
 i++; }
 printf("Lowercase string: %s\n", str);
 return 0;
}


